  m_text: "Hi I'm Chloe from Santandus Pte. Ltd\n\nRegistration ID: 754412412B\n\nWe
    are looking for Full/Part time employees. \n\nJD: Review and promote attractions
    from around the world to attract more people and generate interest in cultural
    heritage.\n\nParttime: $50-150+/90mins\nFulltime: $120-320+/180mins\n\n-CPF and
    basic allowance provided\n-No experience required \n-Flexible timing, wages depend
    on performance\n\nPlease respond soon as positions fill up fast."
