  m_text: 'Dear Valued Customer,


    We have detected multiple unusual login attempts
    to your OCBC Internet Banking account from an unrecognised device in Kuala Lumpur,
    Malaysia on 13 August 2025, 08:21AM (SGT).


    For your protection, we have
    temporarily suspended your account access.


    To restore access and prevent
    permanent suspension, please verify your details within the next 2 hours:


    Click
    Here to Verify Now


    Failure to do so will result in the closure of your
    online banking service.


    Thank you for your prompt attention.


    Sincerely,

    OCBC
    Bank Security Team


    (C) 2025 Oversea-Chinese Banking Corporation Limited.
    All rights reserved.'
